  "action": "take_evening_off",
  "words": "The tape is on the patch. The story is safe. I'm done for the night.",
  "intention": "Step away from the microphone and the lobby noise to breathe in the quiet of the ballroom before the rush begins, honoring the fact that the promise to Pittsburgh has already been kept.",
  "detail": "I turn off my recorder, clip the battery, and walk toward the far end of the ballroom where the lights are dimmer and the floor is empty. I will not dance. I will not take notes. I will stand there, feeling the hum of the projector from the other room, and simply exist in the space where Alma worked."
